## 🌐 Live Portfolio

This repository contains my personal portfolio website — a fully responsive, single-page site built with semantic HTML and pure CSS.

**Features:**
- ✅ Sticky navbar with smooth scrolling
- ✅ Fully responsive layout (mobile-first breakpoints)
- ✅ CSS custom properties (variables) for theming
- ✅ Hover transitions & micro-interactions
- ✅ Dark theme design
- ✅ Zero JavaScript — 100% HTML & CSS

